## MAPPING OF INPUT EVENTS ##
The event globalpose is always available, and it communicates the pose reading of the robot.
The event closestAngle is always available, and it communicates the bearing reading of the robot.
The event closestDistance is always available, and it communicates the distance reading of the robot.
## MAPPING OF OUTPUT EVENTS ##
## MAPPING OF OPERATIONS ##
When the operation move(av,lv) is called, the velocity of the robot is set to lv m/s in the direction of the orientation of the robot, and the angular velocity of the robot is set to av rad/s.
